Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 19:46:01 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mcp): replace the document when opening a project

Load into a fresh world and swap only after success, clearing history and previous-post metadata. Pin nonempty and repeated opens, posted section cardinality, empty-file replacement and failed-load preservation.

Co-Authored-By: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #978
